  "group_variable": "Year",
  "graph_type": "fan_graph",
  "subquestions_order": "MANUAL",
  "description": "2023 was the [hottest year on record](https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-analysis-confirms-2023-as-warmest-year-on-record/), exacerbated by human-made climate change and El Ni\u00f1o. Despite setting new temperature highs in 2023, predictions for 2024 and beyond are uncertain due to the irregular behaviour of the current El Ni\u00f1o.",
  "resolution_criteria": "Each sub-question resolves \"Yes\" if [NASA](https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-analysis-confirms-2023-as-warmest-year-on-record/) officially reports that the year is the hottest year on record to date. It resolves \"No\" otherwise.",
